# Atlas license

Atlas is licensed under your choice of two licenses, both reproduced in
full below: the **PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0** and the
**PolyForm Free Trial License 1.0.0**. The Free Trial license lets you
evaluate Atlas, at work too, for less than 32 consecutive calendar days.

Any other commercial, professional or organizational use requires a
separate commercial license; see "Commercial / enterprise use" below.

