# Commercial / enterprise use

The Noncommercial Purposes section above means **any professional,
business, or organizational use — including internal use by a
for-profit company, even without resale or redistribution — is
not covered by the Noncommercial license**. Such use is covered
only by the Free Trial license above, to evaluate Atlas for less
than 32 consecutive calendar days, or by a separate commercial
license from the copyright holder. Ask for commercial terms at
<https://dfir-systems.de/#contact>.

